<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">我的邀请码</view>
    <view style="font-size: 48rpx; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 8rpx; margin: 20rpx 0;">
      {{info.inviteCode || '----'}}
    </view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">已成功邀请 {{info.inviteCount || 0}} 人</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">
      分享邀请码给好友，好友注册并完成秒杀后，你会自动获得邀请积分奖励。
    </view>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="copyCode">复制邀请码</button>
  </view>
</view>
